  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Infrastructure and Safe Education in T&#xfc;rkiye (RISE T&#xfc;rkiye)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will conduct rapid school safety and infrastructure readiness assessments, assess energy efficiency conditions in selected earthquake-affected schools, strengthen disaster preparedness practices through school emergency teams and drills, and review national education curricula to identify opportunities for integrating disaster risk reduction. By generating actionable evidence, strengthening preparedness behavior, and supporting institutional learning, the project will inform future recovery investments and policy action, contributing to safer, more resilient, and energy-efficient learning environments.</narrative>
  </description>
